---
layout: layouts/base.njk
section: home
---
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    <p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> K0ST'S PERSONAL BLOG</p>
    <h1>把探索，<br>写成<span class="accent">记录。</span></h1>
    <p class="hero-description">{{ site.description }}<br>在这里，整理问题，也留下思考的过程。</p>
    <a class="text-link" href="/posts/">阅读文章 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
  </div>
  <div class="notebook" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="notebook-header"><span class="notebook-dot"></span> notes / README.md <span>↗</span></div>
    <div class="notebook-body"><span class="line-num">01</span><span class="code-heading"># 保持好奇</span><span class="line-num">02</span><span></span><span class="line-num">03</span><span>遇见问题，动手尝试。</span><span class="line-num">04</span><span>把复杂的事情慢慢想清楚。</span><span class="line-num">05</span><span>再用文字，留下一点收获。</span><span class="line-num">06</span><span></span><span class="line-num">07</span><span class="code-comment">// 下一篇，从一个好问题开始。</span></div>
    <div class="notebook-footer"><span>文字 · 代码 · 想法</span><span class="small-square"></span></div>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="home-content" aria-labelledby="latest-heading">
  <div class="article-column">
    <div class="section-heading"><h2 id="latest-heading">最近更新 <span class="section-en">LATEST</span></h2><a href="/posts/">全部文章 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div>
    {% for post in collections.articles %}{% if loop.index <= 5 %}
    <article class="article-row"><div class="post-meta"><time datetime="{{ post.date | isoDate }}">{{ post.date | dateLabel }}</time><span> / </span><span>{{ post.data.category }}</span></div><h3><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}<span class="row-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></h3><p>{{ post.data.description }}</p></article>
    {% endif %}{% endfor %}
    <p class="end-note"><span aria-hidden="true">└</span> 新的记录，慢慢积累。</p>
  </div>
  <aside class="sidebar"><p class="eyebrow">ABOUT THIS SPACE</p><h2>一个记录与思考的地方。</h2><p>不急着给出所有答案，先把每一次探索认真记下来。</p><a class="text-link" href="/about/">关于这个博客 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a><div class="sidebar-bottom"><span class="status-dot"></span> 始于 2026，持续更新</div></aside>
</section>
